{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026AYFqrOI1U61794618761.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>【中大醫院誤切病人雙側卵巢】</p><p>中大醫院一名女病人被錯誤切除雙側卵巢，醫生承認錯誤。院方指是因為手術期間，醫生高度專注處理臨床步驟，出現短暫認知盲點，未能貫徹執行原定手術方案，向病人及家屬致歉，並就事件全面檢討。涉事醫生是中大醫院顧問醫生張德康，他受訪時表示，日後會更小心處理手術程序。</p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1206898-%E4%B8%AD%E5%A4%A7%E9%86%AB%E9%99%A2%E9%8C%AF%E8%AA%A4%E5%88%87%E9%99%A4%E5%A5%B3%E7%97%85%E4%BA%BA%E9%9B%99%E5%81%B4%E5%8D%B5%E5%B7%A2%E9%99%A2%E6%96%B9%E6%8C%87%E5%9B%A0%E9%86%AB%E7%94%9F%E5%87%BA%E7%8F%BE%E7%9F%AD%E6%9A%AB%E8%AA%8D%E7%9F%A5%E7%9B%B2%E9%BB%9E\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢院方向病人及家屬致歉</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1207085-%E4%B8%AD%E5%A4%A7%E9%86%AB%E9%99%A2%E5%86%8D%E5%B0%B1%E9%8C%AF%E8%AA%A4%E5%88%87%E9%99%A4%E5%A5%B3%E7%97%85%E4%BA%BA%E9%9B%99%E5%81%B4%E5%8D%B5%E5%B7%A2%E8%87%B4%E6%AD%89%E6%B6%89%E4%BA%8B%E9%86%AB%E7%94%9F%E6%8C%87%E6%97%A5%E5%BE%8C%E6%9C%83%E6%9B%B4%E5%B0%8F%E5%BF%83%E8%99%95%E7%90%86%E6%89%8B%E8%A1%93\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢涉事醫生：日後會更小心處理手術程序</a></p><p></p><p></p><p>【蔡天鳳碎屍案】</p><p>大埔龍尾村蔡天鳳肢解案續審，死者前夫鄺港智供稱，無接觸過懷疑是兇器的圓頭鎚，又指案發當日，父親鄺球在車上單獨與蔡天鳳見面，其後發現蔡天鳳頭部有血，倒臥車上。他還提及蔡天鳳丈夫譚方駿「鍾意自己」，曾買米線示愛；又形容與蔡天鳳關係複雜、難以解釋。</p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1207484-%E8%94%A1%E5%A4%A9%E9%B3%B3%E7%A2%8E%E5%B1%8D%E6%A1%88%E9%84%BA%E6%B8%AF%E6%99%BA%E6%8C%87%E8%BB%8A%E9%A7%9B%E8%87%B3%E5%A4%A7%E7%BE%8E%E7%9D%A3%E5%81%9C%E8%BB%8A%E5%A0%B4%E6%99%82%E6%AD%BB%E8%80%85%E4%BB%8D%E5%9C%A8%E7%94%9F%E4%B8%8D%E7%9F%A5%E9%84%BA%E7%90%83%E6%9C%83%E7%A2%8E%E5%B1%8D\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢鄺港智供稱不知父親會碎屍</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1207292-%E8%94%A1%E5%A4%A9%E9%B3%B3%E7%A2%8E%E5%B1%8D%E6%A1%88%E9%84%BA%E6%B8%AF%E6%99%BA%E4%BD%9C%E4%BE%9B%E7%A8%B1%E8%AD%9A%E6%96%B9%E9%A7%BF%E6%9B%BE%E8%B2%B7%E7%B1%B3%E7%B7%9A%E7%A4%BA%E6%84%9B%E8%88%87%E5%8F%A6%E5%A4%96%E5%85%A9%E5%A5%B3%E5%BD%A2%E6%88%90%E5%9B%9B%E8%A7%92%E9%97%9C%E4%BF%82\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢鄺港智：曾與蔡天鳳、譚方駿「三個人瞓同一張床」</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1207233-%E8%94%A1%E5%A4%A9%E9%B3%B3%E7%A2%8E%E5%B1%8D%E6%A1%88%E9%84%BA%E7%90%83%E7%A8%B1%E4%B8%8D%E7%9F%A5%E7%82%BA%E4%BD%95%E7%83%B9%E5%B1%8D%E5%BD%A2%E5%AE%B9%E7%95%B6%E6%99%82%E7%B2%BE%E7%A5%9E%E5%B4%A9%E6%BD%B0%E9%84%BA%E6%B8%AF%E6%99%BA%E9%96%8B%E5%A7%8B%E4%BD%9C%E4%BE%9B\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢鄺球稱「不知為何烹屍」</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1207075-%E8%94%A1%E5%A4%A9%E9%B3%B3%E7%A2%8E%E5%B1%8D%E6%A1%88%E9%84%BA%E7%90%83%E7%A8%B1%E6%A1%88%E7%99%BC%E7%BF%8C%E6%97%A5%E8%82%A2%E8%A7%A3%E5%B1%8D%E9%AB%94%E7%94%B1%E6%9C%AC%E4%BA%BA%E5%85%A8%E6%AC%8A%E8%B2%A0%E8%B2%AC%E7%84%A1%E9%97%9C%E5%85%A9%E5%AD%90\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢鄺球稱案發翌日肢解屍體由本人全權負責　與兩子無關</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1206889-%E8%94%A1%E5%A4%A9%E9%B3%B3%E7%A2%8E%E5%B1%8D%E6%A1%88%E9%84%BA%E7%90%83%E9%A6%96%E5%BA%A6%E4%BD%9C%E4%BE%9B%E6%8C%87%E5%A4%A7%E6%B9%AF%E7%85%B2%E7%94%A8%E4%BD%9C%E7%A8%AE%E6%A4%8D%E7%89%A9%E6%9B%BE%E5%8C%AF%E6%AC%BE%E4%B8%89%E5%8D%83%E8%90%AC%E4%BA%88%E8%94%A1%E8%B2%B7%E6%A8%93\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢案發前買大湯煲　鄺球：用作種植物</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1206560-%E8%94%A1%E5%A4%A9%E9%B3%B3%E7%A2%8E%E5%B1%8D%E6%A1%88%E9%84%BA%E6%B8%AF%E5%82%91%E6%89%BF%E8%AA%8D%E5%85%A9%E5%85%84%E5%BC%9F%E6%9B%BE%E6%83%B3%E9%81%8E%E6%8C%87%E6%8E%A7%E7%88%B6%E8%A6%AA%E6%AE%BA%E4%BA%BA%E5%BD%A2%E5%AE%B9%E5%B0%8D%E5%AE%B6%E5%BA%AD%E6%90%8D%E5%A4%B1%E6%9C%80%E5%B0%91\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢鄺港傑承認想過指控父親殺人</a></p><p></p><p></p><p>【新世界供股】</p><p>新世界發展11月15日發公告，建議以「1供11」方式供股，按每股供股價0.9元，集資249億元，規模相當於停牌前市值約兩倍。消息拖累股份復牌後裂口低開，最多急挫四成七。</p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1206484-%E6%96%B0%E4%B8%96%E7%95%8C%E7%99%BC%E5%B1%951%E4%BE%9B11%E9%9B%86%E8%B3%87249%E5%84%84%E7%88%AD%E5%8F%96%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E6%B8%9B%E5%82%B5%E7%A8%B1%E9%9D%9E%E7%82%BA%E6%94%A4%E8%96%84%E6%88%96%E5%89%9D%E5%89%8A%E5%B0%8F%E8%82%A1%E6%9D%B1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢新世界發展集資爭取時間減債</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1206669-%E6%B8%AF%E8%82%A1%E7%B5%90%E6%9D%9F3%E6%97%A5%E8%B7%8C%E5%B8%82%E6%96%B0%E4%B8%96%E7%95%8C%E7%99%BC%E5%B1%95%E5%AE%A3%E5%B8%83%E5%A4%A7%E6%8A%98%E8%AE%93%E4%BE%9B%E8%82%A1%E8%82%A1%E4%BB%BD%E5%BE%A9%E7%89%8C%E6%80%A5%E6%8C%AB%E5%9B%9B%E6%88%90\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢股份復牌急挫四成</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1206827-%E8%B2%A1%E9%87%91%E6%88%B0%E5%A0%B1%E6%96%B0%E4%B8%96%E7%95%8C%E4%BE%9B%E8%82%A1%E4%BE%9B%E4%B8%8D%E4%BE%9B%E5%82%B5%E5%8B%99%E5%B0%88%E5%AE%B6%E6%9C%80%E5%A3%9E%E6%83%85%E6%B3%81%E5%B7%B2%E9%81%8E\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢財金戰報｜債務專家：最壞情況已過</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1207051-%E6%99%82%E4%BA%8B%E9%80%9A%E8%AD%98%E6%96%B0%E4%B8%96%E7%95%8C%E4%BE%9B%E8%82%A1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢時事通識｜新世界供股</a></p><p></p><p></p><p>【TVB 59周年台慶】</p><p>11月19日，無綫集團慶祝59周年台慶，台前幕後一眾職藝員齊齊慶祝。三屆視帝羅嘉良強勢回歸，身穿「一套西裝」的「奇哥」夥拍新世代藝人，帶大家重溫《難兄難弟》的光輝歲月。台慶亦以人工智能製作的短片，感謝工作多年的幕後英雄。</p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1207339-TVB59%E5%91%A8%E5%B9%B4%E5%8F%B0%E6%85%B6%E7%BE%85%E5%98%89%E8%89%AF%E5%BC%B7%E5%8B%A2%E5%9B%9E%E6%AD%B8%E9%80%81%E7%A5%9D%E7%A6%8FAI%E7%9F%AD%E7%89%87%E6%84%9F%E8%AC%9D%E5%B9%95%E5%BE%8C%E8%8B%B1%E9%9B%84\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢點擊重溫台慶精彩環節</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1207339-TVB59%E5%91%A8%E5%B9%B4%E5%8F%B0%E6%85%B6%E7%BE%85%E5%98%89%E8%89%AF%E5%BC%B7%E5%8B%A2%E5%9B%9E%E6%AD%B8%E9%80%81%E7%A5%9D%E7%A6%8FAI%E7%9F%AD%E7%89%87%E6%84%9F%E8%AC%9D%E5%B9%95%E5%BE%8C%E8%8B%B1%E9%9B%84\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢</a><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1205908-%E8%B6%B3%E6%9C%AC%E9%87%8D%E6%BA%AB%E8%90%AC%E5%8D%83%E6%98%9F%E8%BC%9D%E8%B3%80%E5%8F%B0%E6%85%B66%E5%A4%A7%E6%9D%B1%E5%BC%B5%E5%A5%B3%E7%A5%9E%E6%B1%BA%E6%88%B0400%E7%B1%B3%E8%B7%91%E5%87%BA%E6%9D%B1%E5%BC%B5%E7%B2%BE%E7%A5%9E%E6%9D%8E%E6%97%BB%E8%8A%B3%E5%A5%AA%E5%86%A0%E4%BD%95%E6%B2%9B%E7%8F%88%E5%8C%85%E5%B0%BE\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">足本重溫｜萬千星輝賀台慶｜6大「東張女神」決戰400米　跑出東張精神</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1207339-TVB59%E5%91%A8%E5%B9%B4%E5%8F%B0%E6%85%B6%E7%BE%85%E5%98%89%E8%89%AF%E5%BC%B7%E5%8B%A2%E5%9B%9E%E6%AD%B8%E9%80%81%E7%A5%9D%E7%A6%8FAI%E7%9F%AD%E7%89%87%E6%84%9F%E8%AC%9D%E5%B9%95%E5%BE%8C%E8%8B%B1%E9%9B%84\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢</a><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1206107-%E8%B6%B3%E6%9C%AC%E9%87%8D%E6%BA%AB%E8%90%AC%E5%8D%83%E6%98%9F%E8%BC%9D%E8%B3%80%E5%8F%B0%E6%85%B6%E5%BC%B5%E6%8C%AF%E6%9C%97%E5%91%A8%E5%98%89%E6%B4%9B%E6%AD%A6%E6%89%93%E9%A3%9B%E8%BB%8A%E5%8A%89%E7%A9%8E%E9%8F%87%E5%87%8C%E7%A9%BA%E9%89%B8%E5%89%AA%E8%85%B3\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">足本重溫｜萬千星輝賀台慶｜張振朗、周嘉洛武打飛車 劉穎鏇凌空鉸剪腳</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1207410-%E8%90%AC%E5%8D%83%E6%98%9F%E8%BC%9D%E8%B3%80%E5%8F%B0%E6%85%B62026%E4%B8%A8%E9%BB%83%E5%8A%8D%E6%96%87%E9%A3%9F%E9%9B%9E%E9%AB%80%E7%97%9B%E5%A4%B110%E8%90%AC%E5%A4%A7%E7%8D%8E%E4%BA%8B%E5%BE%8C%E8%87%AA%E5%98%B2%E4%BB%8D%E7%84%B6%E5%92%81%E9%8D%BE%E6%84%8F%E9%A3%9F%E9%9B%9E%E9%AB%80\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢黃劍文食雞髀痛失10萬大獎</a></p><p></p><p></p><p>【澳門連續20年向當地居民派錢】</p><p>11月16日，澳門行政長官岑浩輝發表新一份《施政報告》，連續20年向澳門居民派錢，永久居民每人派一萬元，又引入階梯式育兒津貼。</p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1206723-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80%E9%80%A3%E7%BA%8C20%E5%B9%B4%E5%90%91%E7%95%B6%E5%9C%B0%E5%B1%85%E6%B0%91%E6%B4%BE%E9%8C%A2%E5%BC%95%E5%85%A5%E9%9A%8E%E6%A2%AF%E5%BC%8F%E8%82%B2%E5%85%92%E6%B4%A5%E8%B2%BC\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢多項惠民措施延續</a></p><p></p><p></p><p>【APEC｜中俄美元首會晤】</p><p>11月19日，國家主席習近平、俄羅斯總統普京、美國總統特朗普，在深圳舉行歷史性三方會談，並發布和平宣言，涉及能源穩定和核風險等，亦認為國際刑事法院不得濫用管轄權。習近平表示，中俄美最高領導人有史以來首次聚首，具有開創性意義。</p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1207335-%E4%B8%AD%E4%BF%84%E7%BE%8E%E5%85%83%E9%A6%96%E6%9C%83%E6%99%A4%E5%92%8C%E5%B9%B3%E5%AE%A3%E8%A8%80%E6%B6%89%E6%A0%B8%E9%A2%A8%E9%9A%AA%E7%AD%89%E8%AA%8D%E7%82%BA%E5%9C%8B%E9%9A%9B%E5%88%91%E4%BA%8B%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E6%BF%AB%E7%94%A8%E7%AE%A1%E8%BD%84%E6%AC%8A\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢習近平：歷史證明大國和則世界安　大國鬥則世界亂</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1207355-%E4%B8%AD%E4%BF%84%E7%BE%8E%E5%85%83%E9%A6%96%E6%9C%83%E6%99%A4%E7%89%B9%E6%9C%97%E6%99%AE%E6%93%AC%E5%91%A8%E5%85%AD%E9%96%8B%E8%A8%98%E8%80%85%E6%9C%83%E7%8E%8B%E6%AF%85%E6%8C%87%E4%B8%89%E6%96%B9%E5%90%8C%E6%84%8F%E9%98%B2%E6%AD%A2%E8%A1%9D%E7%AA%81%E5%B0%8D%E6%8A%97\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢</a><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1207458-%E4%B8%AD%E4%BF%84%E7%BE%8E%E5%85%83%E9%A6%96%E6%9C%83%E6%99%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%9C%B0%E5%AE%98%E5%AA%92%E6%8C%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%BE%85%E5%A4%A7%E5%9C%8B%E5%A4%9A%E5%8B%B8%E5%92%8C%E4%BF%83%E8%AB%87%E7%BE%8E%E5%AA%92%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90%E4%B8%89%E6%96%B9%E5%90%84%E6%9C%89%E7%9B%A4%E7%AE%97\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">王毅：三方同意防止衝突對抗</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1207572-%E4%B8%AD%E4%BF%84%E7%BE%8E%E5%85%83%E9%A6%96%E6%9C%83%E6%99%A4%E7%89%B9%E6%9C%97%E6%99%AE%E5%BC%B7%E8%AA%BF%E5%90%8C%E4%B8%AD%E4%BF%84%E5%85%83%E9%A6%96%E9%97%9C%E4%BF%82%E8%89%AF%E5%A5%BD%E8%88%87%E7%BF%92%E8%BF%91%E5%B9%B3%E8%AB%87%E5%8F%8A%E9%BB%83%E4%BB%81%E5%8B%B3%E5%A9%9A%E5%A4%96%E6%83%85%E7%AD%89\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢特朗普透露與習近平談及黃仁勳婚外情</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1207478-%E4%B8%AD%E4%BF%84%E7%BE%8E%E5%85%83%E9%A6%96%E6%9C%83%E6%99%A4%E8%82%A2%E9%AB%94%E5%B0%88%E5%AE%B6%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90%E7%BF%92%E7%89%B9%E6%8F%A1%E6%89%8B%E6%93%81%E6%8A%B1%E7%AD%89%E4%BA%92%E5%8B%95%E7%9B%B8%E7%95%B6%E5%90%88%E6%8B%8D%E5%B1%95%E7%8F%BE%E5%9C%98%E7%B5%90\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢肢體專家分析習特握手擁抱等互動相當合拍</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1207588-%E4%B8%AD%E4%BF%84%E7%BE%8E%E5%85%83%E9%A6%96%E6%9C%83%E6%99%A4%E4%B8%98%E6%87%89%E6%A8%BA%E6%8C%87%E4%B8%89%E5%9C%8B%E5%AE%A3%E8%A8%80%E5%86%80%E8%A7%A3%E6%B1%BA%E4%B8%96%E7%95%8C%E7%B4%9B%E7%88%AD%E6%9C%AC%E6%B8%AF%E6%8C%81%E5%AF%A9%E6%85%8E%E6%A8%82%E8%A7%80%E6%85%8B%E5%BA%A6%E8%A9%95%E4%BC%B0\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢丘應樺：本港審慎樂觀評估環球局勢</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1207068-%E4%B8%96%E7%95%8C%E8%A7%80%E4%B8%AD%E4%BF%84%E7%BE%8E%E5%85%83%E9%A6%96%E6%9C%83%E6%99%A4%E8%AA%B0%E6%98%AF%E6%9C%80%E5%A4%A7%E8%B4%8F%E5%AE%B6\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢世界觀｜破天荒舉行三方會談　誰是最大贏家？</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1207461-%E4%B8%AD%E4%BF%84%E7%BE%8E%E5%85%83%E9%A6%96%E6%B7%B1%E5%9C%B3%E6%AD%B7%E5%8F%B2%E6%80%A7%E6%9C%83%E6%99%A4%E7%B4%90%E6%99%82%E9%9B%A3%E6%94%B9%E4%B8%AD%E4%BF%84%E9%95%B7%E6%9C%9F%E5%B0%8D%E7%BE%8E%E7%AB%8B%E5%A0%B4%E5%9C%8B%E9%9A%9B%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢國際分析｜《紐時》：難改中俄長期對美立場</a></p><p></p><p></p><p>【APEC｜提出「深圳展望」】</p><p>APEC領導人非正式會議11月19日閉幕，會議一致通過2026年亞太經合組織領導人宣言，就亞太共同體建設提出「深圳展望」，以及貿易、聯通及創新領域三項成果文件。</p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1207340-APEC%E5%B0%B1%E4%BA%9E%E5%A4%AA%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E9%AB%94%E5%BB%BA%E8%A8%AD%E6%8F%90%E6%B7%B1%E5%9C%B3%E5%B1%95%E6%9C%9B%E7%8E%8B%E6%AF%85%E5%85%AD%E5%80%8B%E6%96%B9%E9%9D%A2%E5%8F%96%E5%BE%97%E9%87%8D%E8%A6%81%E9%80%B2%E5%B1%95\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢成果包括搭建亞太共同體「四樑八柱」</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1207213-APEC%E9%A0%98%E5%B0%8E%E4%BA%BA%E6%9C%83%E8%AD%B0%E7%BF%92%E8%BF%91%E5%B9%B3%E7%B1%B2%E6%88%90%E5%93%A1%E7%B6%93%E6%BF%9F%E9%AB%94%E6%94%9C%E6%89%8B%E6%87%89%E5%B0%8D%E6%8C%91%E6%88%B0%E5%B0%87%E8%A8%AD%E4%BA%9E%E5%A4%AA%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E9%AB%94%E7%A0%94%E7%A9%B6%E4%B8%AD%E5%BF%83\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢中方提供二千萬美元設「亞太共同體研究中心</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1207135-APEC%E4%B8%AD%E4%BF%84%E7%BE%8E%E5%85%83%E9%A6%96%E6%9C%83%E6%99%A4%E5%89%8D%E5%A4%95%E7%9F%AD%E6%9A%AB%E4%BA%92%E5%8B%95%E7%BF%92%E8%BF%91%E5%B9%B3%E8%88%87%E9%A6%96%E6%AC%A1%E8%A8%AA%E8%8F%AF%E9%AB%98%E5%B8%82%E6%8F%A1%E6%89%8B\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢中俄美元首「世紀同框」</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1207136-APEC%E7%BF%92%E8%BF%91%E5%B9%B3%E6%8C%87%E5%88%B0%E6%A9%9F%E5%A0%B4%E8%A6%AA%E8%BF%8E%E5%B1%AC%E7%A6%AE%E5%B0%9A%E5%BE%80%E4%BE%86%E7%89%B9%E6%9C%97%E6%99%AE%E7%A8%B1%E6%AF%8F%E6%AC%A1%E6%9C%83%E6%99%A4%E9%83%BD%E9%9D%9E%E5%B8%B8%E6%84%89%E5%BF%AB\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢習近平機場親迎特朗普</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1207449-APEC%E7%BF%92%E8%BF%91%E5%B9%B3%E5%B0%B1%E4%B8%AD%E6%BE%B3%E9%97%9C%E4%BF%82%E6%8F%90%E5%9B%9B%E9%BB%9E%E6%84%8F%E8%A6%8B%E9%BB%83%E5%BE%AA%E8%B2%A1%E7%A8%B1%E9%A1%98%E8%88%87%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%B9%E5%A2%9E%E5%BC%B7%E6%94%BF%E6%B2%BB%E4%BA%92%E4%BF%A1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢習近平會晤與會國家領導人</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1207274-APEC%E6%9D%8E%E5%AE%B6%E8%B6%85%E7%B8%BD%E7%B5%90%E5%B3%B0%E6%9C%83%E8%A1%8C%E7%A8%8B%E6%8C%87%E6%9C%89%E4%BA%94%E5%A4%A7%E6%88%90%E6%9E%9C%E5%90%91%E7%BF%92%E8%BF%91%E5%B9%B3%E4%BB%8B%E7%B4%B9%E5%A4%A7%E7%81%A3%E5%8D%80%E6%A9%9F%E9%81%87%E7%A0%94%E8%A8%8E%E6%83%85%E6%B3%81\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢李家超總結峰會行程五大成果</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1206846-%E6%99%82%E4%BA%8B%E9%80%9A%E8%AD%98%E4%B8%AD%E5%9C%8B%E4%B8%89%E6%AC%A1%E4%B8%BB%E8%BE%A6%E4%BA%9E%E5%A4%AA%E7%B6%93%E5%90%88%E7%B5%84%E7%B9%94APEC%E6%9C%83%E8%AD%B0\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢時事通識｜中國三次主辦APEC會議</a></p><p></p><p></p><p>【習近平考察中山】</p><p>中共總書記、國家主席習近平到廣東中山考察，強調要奮力開創粵港澳大灣區高質量發展新局面。他又到訪孫中山故居紀念館。</p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1206692-%E7%BF%92%E8%BF%91%E5%B9%B3%E5%BC%B7%E8%AA%BF%E5%A5%AE%E5%8A%9B%E9%96%8B%E5%89%B5%E5%A4%A7%E7%81%A3%E5%8D%80%E9%AB%98%E8%B3%AA%E9%87%8F%E7%99%BC%E5%B1%95%E6%96%B0%E5%B1%80%E9%9D%A2%E5%88%B0%E8%A8%AA%E5%AD%AB%E4%B8%AD%E5%B1%B1%E6%95%85%E5%B1%85%E7%B4%80%E5%BF%B5%E9%A4%A8\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢提倡推進大灣區交通一體化</a></p><p></p><p></p><p>【羅大佑斥民進黨箝制言論自由】</p><p>台灣歌手羅大佑近日批評民進黨當局箝制言論自由，導致台灣文化水準下降。在北京，國台辦指民進黨推進文化「台獨」，令台灣民眾心生恐懼。</p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1207079-%E7%BE%85%E5%A4%A7%E4%BD%91%E6%96%A5%E6%B0%91%E9%80%B2%E9%BB%A8%E7%AE%9D%E5%88%B6%E8%A8%80%E8%AB%96%E8%87%AA%E7%94%B1%E5%9C%8B%E5%8F%B0%E8%BE%A6%E6%89%B9%E6%8E%A8%E9%80%B2%E6%96%87%E5%8C%96%E5%8F%B0%E7%8D%A8%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%B0%E7%81%A3%E6%B0%91%E7%9C%BE%E5%BF%83%E7%94%9F%E6%81%90%E6%87%BC\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢批評民進黨降低文化門檻</a></p><p></p><p></p><p>【黃仁勳無望重掌輝達？】</p><p>美國晶片龍頭輝達Nvidia創辦人黃仁勳卸任行政總裁後，11月17日首次發聲明，稱一旦獲公司董事會邀請，他願意復職。但董事會其後表示，沒打算恢復黃仁勳的職務。美國傳媒指，當局未有足夠情報，確認黃仁勳外遇對象之一的黃樂是否中國間諜。</p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1206965-%E9%BB%83%E4%BB%81%E5%8B%B3%E8%BE%AD%E8%81%B7%E7%99%BC%E8%81%B2%E6%98%8E%E7%A8%B1%E9%A1%98%E5%BE%A9%E4%BB%BB%E8%BC%9D%E9%81%94CEO%E8%91%A3%E4%BA%8B%E6%9C%83%E4%B8%BB%E5%B8%AD%E6%B2%92%E6%89%93%E7%AE%97%E6%81%A2%E5%BE%A9%E5%85%B6%E8%81%B7%E5%8B%99\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢黃仁勳稱視輝達為終生事業</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1207217-%E9%BB%83%E4%BB%81%E5%8B%B3%E8%BE%AD%E8%81%B7%E8%BC%9D%E9%81%94%E8%91%A3%E4%BA%8B%E6%9C%83%E7%A8%B1%E5%BF%85%E9%A0%88%E5%B0%8B%E6%B1%82%E6%96%B0%E9%A0%98%E5%B0%8E%E4%BA%BA%E6%8E%A5%E6%9B%BF%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E6%8F%90%E5%89%8D%E5%8A%A0%E8%96%AA%E5%86%80%E9%87%8D%E6%8C%AF%E5%A3%AB%E6%B0%A3\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢輝達提前加薪冀重振士氣</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1207160-%E8%BC%9D%E9%81%94%E5%AD%A3%E7%B8%BE%E8%BC%83%E5%B8%82%E5%A0%B4%E9%A0%90%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E6%9C%AA%E8%83%BD%E6%89%AD%E8%BD%89%E8%B7%8C%E5%8B%A2%E7%BE%8E%E8%82%A1%E4%B8%89%E5%A4%A7%E6%8C%87%E6%95%B8%E5%80%8B%E5%88%A5%E7%99%BC%E5%B1%95\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢季績好未能扭轉股價跌勢</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1206870-%E9%BB%83%E4%BB%81%E5%8B%B3%E8%BE%AD%E8%81%B7%E9%83%A8%E5%88%86%E8%BC%9D%E9%81%94%E5%93%A1%E5%B7%A5%E7%AD%89%E8%81%AF%E7%BD%B2%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E9%BB%83%E4%BB%81%E5%8B%B3%E9%87%8D%E8%BF%94%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E5%B1%A4%E9%A6%AC%E6%96%AF%E5%85%8B%E6%9C%89%E4%BB%BD%E8%81%AF%E7%BD%B2\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢特朗普：不介意黃仁勳回巢</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1206478-%E9%BB%83%E4%BB%81%E5%8B%B3%E8%BE%AD%E8%81%B7%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90%E6%8C%87%E4%BB%A5%E8%89%B2%E5%88%97%E7%82%BA%E5%B9%95%E5%BE%8C%E6%8E%A8%E6%89%8B%E5%9C%96%E6%89%B6%E6%8C%81%E6%9B%B4%E8%B2%BC%E5%90%88%E8%87%AA%E8%BA%AB%E5%88%A9%E7%9B%8A%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E8%80%85%E5%9F%B7%E6%8E%8C%E8%BC%9D%E9%81%94\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢以色列為幕後推手？</a></p><p></p><p></p><p>【Anthropic納斯達克首掛】</p><p>美國人工智能公司Anthropic於納斯達克掛牌，躍升為全球第12大市值企業。市場關注抽走大量資金，觸發股市調整，又質疑公司收入能否支撐高估值。</p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1207420-Anthropic%E8%BA%8D%E5%8D%87%E5%85%A8%E7%90%83%E7%AC%AC12%E5%A4%A7%E5%B8%82%E5%80%BC%E4%BC%81%E6%A5%AD%E5%B8%82%E5%A0%B4%E8%B3%AA%E7%96%91%E6%94%B6%E5%85%A5%E8%83%BD%E5%90%A6%E6%94%AF%E6%92%90%E9%AB%98%E4%BC%B0%E5%80%BC\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢市值超越巴菲特投資旗艦巴郡</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1207393-%E7%B4%90%E7%B4%84%E7%AD%89%E5%9C%B0%E6%9C%89%E6%B0%91%E7%9C%BE%E7%A4%BA%E5%A8%81%E6%8A%97%E8%AD%B0ANTHROPIC%E4%B8%8A%E5%B8%82\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢民眾示威抗議Anthropic上市</a></p><p></p><p></p><p>【實行種族滅絕罪名成立】</p><p>國際法院裁定緬甸對羅興亞人實行種族滅絕，罪名成立，緬甸指裁決不公平。歐盟指要為受害者伸張正義，美國就稱防止國際法院遭政治化。</p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1207532-%E5%9C%8B%E9%9A%9B%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E7%B7%AC%E7%94%B8%E5%B0%8D%E7%BE%85%E8%88%88%E4%BA%9E%E4%BA%BA%E5%AF%A6%E6%96%BD%E7%A8%AE%E6%97%8F%E6%BB%85%E7%B5%95%E7%BD%AA%E6%88%90%E7%B7%AC%E7%94%B8%E6%8C%87%E4%B8%8D%E5%85%AC%E5%B9%B3\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢緬甸外交部：深感失望</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1207365-%E5%9C%8B%E9%9A%9B%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%A3%81%E5%AE%9A%E7%B7%AC%E7%94%B8%E5%B0%8D%E7%BE%85%E8%88%88%E4%BA%9E%E4%BA%BA%E5%AF%A6%E8%A1%8C%E7%A8%AE%E6%97%8F%E6%BB%85%E7%B5%95%E7%BD%AA%E5%90%8D%E6%88%90%E7%AB%8B%E7%BE%8E%E5%9C%8B%E7%A8%B1%E9%98%B2%E6%AD%A2%E6%94%BF%E6%B2%BB%E5%8C%96\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢美國憂以色列因加沙局勢被針對</a></p><p></p><p></p><p>【高市來華受冷待？】</p><p>日本首相高市早苗早前到訪深圳，出席APEC領導人非正式會議期間，兩次與國家主席習近平握手。日方稱兩人握手以外，沒有其他交流。對於高市的禮賓安排，中方稱是根據國際慣例。</p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1207159-APEC%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%B9%E5%B0%8D%E5%BE%85%E7%BE%8E%E6%97%A5%E9%A0%98%E8%A2%96%E8%A6%8F%E6%A0%BC%E5%A4%A7%E4%B8%8D%E5%90%8C%E6%97%A5%E5%AA%92%E6%96%99%E4%B8%AD%E6%97%A5%E9%A6%96%E8%85%A6%E8%88%89%E8%A1%8C%E6%9C%83%E8%AB%87%E9%9B%A3%E5%BA%A6%E5%A4%A7\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢歡迎儀式規模較細</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1207286-APEC%E9%AB%98%E5%B8%82%E6%97%A9%E8%8B%97%E9%80%A3%E7%BA%8C%E5%85%A9%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C%E7%BF%92%E8%BF%91%E5%B9%B3%E6%8F%A1%E6%89%8B%E6%8C%87%E6%9C%AA%E7%8D%B2%E5%9B%9E%E6%87%89%E5%85%B6%E8%AA%AA%E8%A9%B1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢主動與習近平說話未獲回應</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1207325-APEC%E5%8C%97%E4%BA%AC%E6%8C%87%E9%AB%98%E5%B8%82%E7%A6%AE%E8%B3%93%E5%AE%89%E6%8E%92%E6%8C%89%E5%9C%8B%E9%9A%9B%E6%85%A3%E4%BE%8B%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%B9%E5%B0%8D%E4%B8%AD%E6%97%A5%E9%97%9C%E4%BF%82%E7%AB%8B%E5%A0%B4%E6%98%8E%E7%A2%BA\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢中方指對中日關係立場明確</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1207276-APEC%E6%97%A5%E6%8F%86%E9%AB%98%E5%B8%82%E6%97%A9%E8%8B%97%E6%B7%B1%E5%9C%B3%E5%A4%9A%E7%95%AA%E7%88%AD%E5%8F%96%E4%BA%92%E5%8B%95%E6%9C%AA%E7%8D%B2%E5%9B%9E%E6%87%89%E5%AD%B8%E8%80%85%E6%8C%87%E4%B8%AD%E6%97%A5%E9%97%9C%E4%BF%82%E9%9B%A3%E7%A0%B4%E5%86%B0%E5%9C%8B%E9%9A%9B%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90\" re